Chapter: ProvokeData

 Modified UOX3 NPC data, GPL-2.0-or-later. Copyright 1997, 98 Marcus Rating (Cironian); see the retained UOX3
 license, ports/UOX3-LICENSE.txt. Each WorldSpawnData profile key with its TOPROV (data/dfndata/npc, through GET
 parents, a variant key read as its base section), in tenths of Provocation; -1 is a profile UOX3 gives no TOPROV.
  pvd-difficulty : Text -> Integer
  pvd-difficulty (key) = pvd-0 key
  pvd-0 : Text -> Integer
  pvd-0 (k) = if k == "alligator" then 322 else if k == "bullfrog" then 292 else pvd-1 k
